# What is sent to Expo's build service when the phone app in mobile/ is built.
#
# Expo uploads the whole repository by default, which is hundreds of megabytes
# of website, desktop and working files the phone build never reads. Only
# mobile/ is needed. This file replaces .gitignore for that upload, so the
# usual exclusions are repeated here.
/*
!/mobile
node_modules/
.expo/
.claude/
/mobile/android/
/mobile/ios/
/mobile/dist/
*.log
.env*
